  "暖风炉（Furnace）": "Furnace (forced air)", "锅炉 + 暖气片": "Boiler + radiators", "热泵": "Heat pump", "中央空调": "Central AC", "全屋加湿器": "Whole-house humidifier", "软水机": "Water softener",
