  "账单金额随季节变化，设了自动扣款也看一眼夏冬的峰值。": "Amounts swing with the seasons; even on autopay, glance at the summer and winter peaks.",
  "芝加哥市区水费一般两个月一张账单；郊区各镇不同。": "Chicago city water bills every two months; suburbs vary by town.",
  "促销价通常 12 个月后上涨，记录里会标“涨价了”。": "Promo pricing usually ends after 12 months; the history flags “Price up”.",
  "独栋多数没有 HOA；联排、公寓按章程，有的是季付。特别评估另建一条一次性账单。": "Most single-family homes have no HOA; townhomes and condos follow their bylaws, some quarterly. Add special assessments as a one-time bill.",
  "Cook County 第一期约 3 月 1 日，金额为上年的 55%。在 escrow 里由贷款行代缴的，记成“已核对”即可。": "Cook County 1st installment around March 1, 55% of last year's total. If paid from escrow by the lender, just log it as Verified.",
  "第二期日期每年公布，常在 8 月初到年底之间；收到账单后把到期日改准。": "The 2nd installment date is announced yearly, usually between early August and year end; update the due date when the bill arrives.",
  "多数贷款 15 天宽限期；escrow 变化时月供会调整，核对一下。": "Most loans allow a 15-day grace period; the payment changes when escrow is adjusted, so verify.",
  "续保通知一般提前 30–45 天；在 escrow 里的记成核对。到期日建后补填。": "Renewal notices arrive 30–45 days ahead; if paid from escrow, log as Verified. Set the due date after creating.",
  "半年一续，续保前比价。到期日建后补填。": "Renews every six months; shop around before renewing. Set the due date after creating.",
  "设了全额自动还款也要核对账单有没有陌生消费；到期日 = 账单日 + 21–25 天。": "Even with autopay in full, check the statement for unfamiliar charges; due date = statement date + 21–25 days.",
  "预付费电表的记成“充值”，按余额提醒。": "For prepaid meters, treat this as a top-up and remind by balance.", "多数按年包，续费前比价。到期日建后补填。": "Mostly annual plans; compare before renewing. Set the due date after creating.",
  "有的小区按年或半年预收，按实际改频率。": "Some complexes collect yearly or semiannually; adjust the frequency to match.", "提前一天把钱转到扣款卡。": "Move the money to the autopay card the day before.",
  "交强险 + 商业险一年一续。到期日建后补填。": "Compulsory plus commercial insurance renew yearly. Set the due date after creating.", "设了自动还款也核对账单。": "Verify the statement even with autopay.",
  "自动续费常比首年贵，到期前决定要不要续。": "Auto-renewal often costs more than the first year; decide before it renews.",

